1.df => Show file system disk usage
2.df -h => Show disk usage in MB/GB/TB
3.du  => Show disk usage per directory
4.du -h => Show disk usage in MB/GB/TB
5.free => Show memory usage
6.free -h => Show memory usage in MB/GB/TB
7.uptime => Show uptime
8.whoami =>Show current user
9.uname => Show system information
10.uname -a => Show all system information
